    "forensics": "Trades #1 (TATASTEEL) and #2 (AXISBANK) suffered slow-bleed stop-outs on exactly a 0.60% adverse move during the late-morning/midday liquidity lull (10:25\u201313:25 IST), indicating that our 0.60% stop-loss sits directly inside routine intraday mean-reversion noise for heavyweights. Trade #7 (ICICIBANK) entered late at 14:10 IST and stagnated into the 15:25 EOD square-off, where transaction fees (\u20b94.02) doubled a minor \u20b92.00 gross scratch into a net loss, highlighting severe fee drag on low-conviction afternoon entries.",
